^"usage"{
  surface: "primes"
  role: "cutout-arrangement"
  formats_available: ["avif", "webp"]
  ground: "clear — the black behind the cutouts was the scanner lid seen through a clear sheet, so every tier keys it to transparent; a page gives the piece its ground"
  orientation: "the books card and the due-date cutouts run sideways, reading bottom to top"
  alt_text: "Cutouts on a clear sheet: the skills-gap card, performance list, a kraft-backed MUSIC badge, domino tiles bracketed to 1600, and sideways cards: Books (novels) are 1 reason to do 50,000 things in order, due NOV 26!, Today is!"
